 ('ENT_ANGF_MALCHIDAEL','PER_RENAISSANCE','Angel governing Aries in Agrippa''s Scale of Twelve (also spelled Malahidael/Machidiel). Attested Agrippa II.14; Davidson, Dictionary of Angels.'),
 ('ENT_ANGF_ASMODEL','PER_RENAISSANCE','Angel governing Taurus in Agrippa''s Scale of Twelve. Attested Agrippa II.14; Davidson. Not to be confused with the demon Asmodeus.'),
 ('ENT_ANGF_AMBRIEL','PER_RENAISSANCE','Angel governing Gemini in Agrippa''s Scale of Twelve. Attested Agrippa II.14; Davidson.'),
 ('ENT_ANGF_MURIEL','PER_RENAISSANCE','Angel governing Cancer in Agrippa''s Scale of Twelve. Attested Agrippa II.14; Davidson.'),
 ('ENT_ANGF_VERCHIEL','PER_RENAISSANCE','Angel governing Leo in Agrippa''s Scale of Twelve (also Verachiel). Attested Agrippa II.14; Davidson.'),
 ('ENT_ANGF_HAMALIEL','PER_RENAISSANCE','Angel governing Virgo in Agrippa''s Scale of Twelve. Attested Agrippa II.14; Davidson.'),
