 ('ENT_ANGF_BARBIEL','PER_RENAISSANCE','Angel governing Scorpio in Agrippa''s Scale of Twelve (also a name among the planetary/lunar mansions in other lists). Attested Agrippa II.14; Davidson.'),
 ('ENT_ANGF_ADVACHIEL','PER_RENAISSANCE','Angel governing Sagittarius in Agrippa''s Scale of Twelve; spelled Advachiel by Agrippa, commonly Adnachiel in later angelologies. Attested Agrippa II.14; Davidson.'),
 ('ENT_ANGF_HANAEL','PER_RENAISSANCE','Angel governing Capricorn in Agrippa''s Scale of Twelve. HOMONYM: distinct from the archangel Haniel of Venus/Netzach (ENT_JM_HANIEL); the same name-stem is reused for a zodiacal governor here. Attested Agrippa II.14; Davidson.'),
